s!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/668a2c3e661594088919545aa1ae12b9.avif?t=1758892968\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/c24579b559c25f86a6e85892e5badfb7.avif?t=1758892968\" width=563 height=1102 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/2b64ccaa024c2b79c52838c6c82a3bf7.avif?t=1758892968\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br><br>Every course in Fling to the Finish has a unique theme and style. Race through floating parks, giant casinos, and even worm filled asteroid fields to reach the finish line! We designed every obstacle to force you to use the rope in a new way, so every second is filled with new surprises and memorable moments. The race track even evolves to challenge you as you play, so every race is a nail biter. You'll never know what weird obstacle you'll find next. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/50e6b05894395203d6545c5bb2823c52.poster.avif?t=1758892968\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/50e6b05894395203d6545c5bb2823c52.webm?t=1758892968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/50e6b05894395203d6545c5bb2823c52.mp4?t=1758892968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054430/extras/af1426ade1df768a7b1399fa2544cc23.avif?t=1758892968\" width=616 height=220 /><